    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Monera is the ONLY kingdom among the five that contains prokaryotic organisms.",
        "In Binomial Nomenclature, the Genus name starts with a capital letter, while the Species name starts with a lowercase letter, both italicized when printed.",
        "Carl Woese's Three Domain System splits the kingdom Monera into Archaea and Bacteria domains.",
        "Taxonomic Hierarchy Order (Highest to Lowest): Kingdom -> Phylum/Division -> Class -> Order -> Family -> Genus -> Species."
      ],
